00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:06,000
Some women would kill for a baby

2
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:06,000
Inside is a horror, thriller film directed by Miguel Ángel Vivas.

3
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:06,000
Completely on her own, Sarah spends her time at home,
waiting for the approaching birth of her child.

4
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:06,000
But one night, a stranger breaks into her home, ready to
snatch her still unborn baby from her.

5
00:25:00,000 --> 00:25:06,000
Sarah Clark, played by Rachel Nichols.

6
00:30:00,000 --> 00:30:06,000
Madeleine Sherman, played by Laura Harring.

7
00:35:00,000 --> 00:35:06,000
Isaac, played by Ben Temple.

8
00:40:00,000 --> 00:40:06,000
Sarah's Mother, played by Gillian Apter.

9
00:45:00,000 --> 00:45:06,000
Police Woman, played by Andrea Tivadar.

10
00:50:00,000 --> 00:50:06,000
Police Officer 3, played by Craig Stevenson.

11
00:55:00,000 --> 00:55:06,000
Inside is a 2016 English-language Spanish horror film directed Miguel Ángel Vivas,
who co-wrote the screenplay with Jaume Balagueró and Manu Díez.

12
01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
It stars Rachel Nichols and Laura Harring.

13
01:05:00,000 --> 01:05:06,000
The plot follows a pregnant woman pursued by a psychotic woman
trying to steal her unborn child on Christmas Eve.

14
01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:06,000
It is a remake of the 2007 French film of the same name.

15
01:15:00,000 --> 01:15:06,000
The film had its premiere on 7 October 2016 at the Sitges Film Festival.

16
01:20:00,000 --> 01:20:06,000
The tone is dark and intense.
